      "writtenOn": "2023-03-23T15:45:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Have you considered making the right end exclusive?\n\nI agree that most ranges are exclusive right side. \n\nMy decision was motivated by the fact that we need to represent the max bound of the backing type:  e.g. `0..0xffff`. It is less cumbersome to ask users to use only values that can be represented on the type.\n\nAlso ranges in the protocol specifications are more likely to be presented with inclusive bounds.",
      "parentUuid": "8bb1f780_7fa11ad2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 167,
        "startChar": 69,
        "endLine": 167,
        "endChar": 91
      },
