      "writtenOn": "2023-03-23T08:18:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure that I love such accessors: they move a `match` expression to the accessor, but the calling code will now either use an `unwrap()` or it will have the same `match` expression (you see the `unwrap()` below).\n\nOverall, I think it\u0027s better to let the callers deal with the cases — they must know about them at some point, right?",
